-- Scenario revisions (ADR 0013, docs/domain.md "Revisions"): the open part, which everyone in the
-- organization reads, and the restricted part, hidden without rate access (ADR 0005). Generated by
-- drizzle-kit from src/db/schema.ts, then by hand at the end: FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY (ADR 0004)
-- and no UPDATE for the app role, since a revision once written never changes. The app keeps
-- DELETE, which deleting an organization needs (ADR 0012); a revision's own cascades and the author
-- cleared on an account's deletion run as the owner, so they need no UPDATE either.
CREATE TYPE "public"."revision_reason" AS ENUM('saved', 'shared', 'chosen');--> statement-breakpoint
